  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: calculix\n  version: \"2.23\"\n  sha256: 9c88385c10fb04f5dc6c4e98027a51bebdd8aee3920e05190d6c1dd08357d6e7\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: http://www.dhondt.de/ccx_${{ version }}.src.tar.bz2\n  sha256: ${{ sha256 }}\n  patches:\n    - patches/avoid-ifport.patch\n    - patches/fix-readnewmesh-return.patch\n    # submitted upstream; drop these when they land in a release\n    - patches/upstream-f2f-contact-array-bounds.patch\n    - patches/upstream-frictionless-contact-slip.patch\n    - patches/upstream-nonlinmpc-straight-mpc.patch\n    - patches/upstream-mohrcoulomb-degenerate-return.patch\n    - patches/upstream-readfrd-return-value.patch\n    - patches/upstream-locale-numeric.patch\n    - patches/upstream-makefile-inc-mafillmm.patch\n    # threaded *CFD applied MPC's before the SPC's they read; fixed upstream\n    # by the OpenMP rewrite of compfluidfem (9e8ce89); drop once released\n    - patches/fix-cfd-threaded-boundary-conditions.patch\n    # 2.23 creates and joins threads for every loop of every *CFD iteration,\n    # so small meshes run several times slower threaded than on one core\n    - patches/fix-cfd-small-mesh-threads.patch\n    # defects Dhondt fixed upstream after 2.23 was posted (2 Nov 2025), up to\n    # e9e57ed of 17 Sep 2026; drop these when 2.24 is released\n    - patches/upstream-initial-conditions-solution.patch\n    - patches/upstream-boundary-fixed-cylindrical.patch\n    - patches/upstream-gen3dnor-expansion-normals.patch\n    - patches/upstream-materialdata-th-density.patch\n    - patches/upstream-nonlingeo-intscheme.patch\n    - patches/upstream-c3d8r-stable-time-increment.patch\n    - patches/upstream-allocation-debug-print.patch\n    - patches/upstream-friction-stick-slope.patch\n    - if: win or osx\n      then: patches/mingw_time.patch\n    - if: win\n      then: patches/fix-win-locale.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 5\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - make\n    - perl\n    - if: unix\n      then:\n        - ${{ compiler(\"c\") }}\n        - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n        - ${{ compiler(\"fortran\") }}\n    - if: win\n      then:\n        - ${{ compiler('m2w64_c') }}\n        - ${{ stdlib('m2w64_c') }}\n        - ${{ compiler('m2w64_fortran') }}\n    - if: osx\n      then:\n        - llvm-openmp\n  host:\n    - libblas\n    - liblapack\n    - arpack\n    # spoolesMT.a is linked statically and its data races were only fixed in\n    # build 1006, so an older build bakes silently wrong threaded results into\n    # ccx with nothing at run time to express the constraint; see Makefile_MT\n    - spooles[version ='>=2.2',build_number='>=1006']\n    - if: osx\n      then:\n        - llvm-openmp\n  run:\n    - arpack\n    - if: osx\n      then:\n        - llvm-openmp\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - if: unix\n        then: test -f $PREFIX/bin/ccx\n      - if: win\n        then: if not exist %LIBRARY_PREFIX%\\bin\\ccx.exe exit 1\n  # a build that links but miscomputes has shipped from here before, so\n  # actually solve something and check the numbers\n  - script: python run_test.py\n    files:\n      recipe:\n        - run_test.py\n        - smoketest.inp\n        - contact.inp\n        - contact.dat.ref\n        - mohr.inp\n        - restart.inp\n        - cfd.inp\n        - cfd.dat.ref\n    requirements:\n      run:\n        - python\n\nabout:\n  license: GPL-2.0-or-later\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: 3D Structural Finite Element Program\n  description: A Free Software Three-Dimensional Structural Finite Element Program\n  homepage: https://www.dhondt.de/\n  repository: https://github.com/Dhondtguido/CalculiX\n  documentation: https://www.dhondt.de/ccx_${{ version }}.pdf\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - oursland\n    - looooo\n    - Krande\n",
